This licence covers the source code only. It does not cover:

- Photographs in public/img/ and pipeline/sources/. Each photo keeps its own
  licence, and its author, licence and source link are recorded in
  src/data/spots.json and pipeline/sources/sources.json.
- AI-restored images (public/img/*_ai.jpg). These are derived from the
  photographs above and follow the licence of the original photo.
- Aerial imagery, which is loaded at runtime from the City of Warsaw WMS
  (© m.st. Warszawa) and is not distributed with this repository, except for
  the excerpt in public/img/og/default.jpg.
- Third-party model weights (Real-ESRGAN, BSD-3-Clause; DDColor, Apache-2.0)
  and fonts (Fraunces, Inter, Geist; SIL Open Font License), which are
  downloaded separately under their own licences.
